WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.561 --> 00:00:01.863
Narrator: Thirty minutes to kick-off.

2
00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:05.615
Narrator: A wheelchair user, his mother with a walking stick, his pregnant wife and a baby in a stroller.

3
00:00:09.062 --> 00:00:10.929
Narrator: Their seats are on the upper level.

4
00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:13.002
Majed: Gate 5 - just up those stairs!

5
00:00:13.209 --> 00:00:14.938
Narrator: Majed sends them to the stairs.

6
00:00:15.145 --> 00:00:19.430
Narrator: In this lesson: the right route, the right service, and the right way to offer it.
